---
title: Matcha sponge cake
source: https://pastryliving.com/fluffy-matcha-green-tea-sponge-cake/
cuisine: Japanese
---

Pre-heat the oven to !350F.

In a #bowl combine @egg{4} and @sugar{140 g}. Whip on high speed for ~{5 minutes} until pale and fluffy.

Fold in @flour{110 g} and @matcha powder{10 g} until just combined.

Fold in @milk{30 g} and @oil{30 g} until just combined.

Pour the batter into a #cake pan{} lined with #parchment paper{}.

Bake for ~{25 minutes} or until a toothpick inserted into the center comes out clean.

> If making a layered cake, use a sheet pan and bake for ~{20 minutes}.
